# The test runners take these from the shell, not from .env, e.g.
#   POLYGON_RPC_URL=https://your-archive-rpc.example make test-fork-contained

# POLYGON_RPC_URL: archive-capable Polygon PoS RPC, required by the fork targets. Fork tests only read state;
# nothing is sent.

# FORK_BLOCK: overrides 94421000, the pinned fork block of the test/fork suite (docs/STEP-1-GAS-ABSTRACTION.md §11).
# The relay's fork E2E forks a recent block unless FORK_BLOCK is set.
